<title>USA: U.S. meat output 1.6 pct below week ago - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. meat output 1.6 pct below week ago - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Red meat production for week ending Saturday, Feb 22, fell 1.6 pct at 786.1 million lbs.-USDA</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING/1  BEEF   CALF/VEAL   PORK/2 LAMB/MUTTON TOTALS/3</p>
<p>22-Feb-97	456.6     6.9	317.3	5.3	786.1</p>
<p>15-Feb-97	463.5     6.9	322.8	5.4	798.6</p>
<p>Change:	   -1.5%    0.0%	-1.7%    -1.9%     -1.6%</p>
<p>24-Feb-96	492.5     6.8	335.7	5.7	840.7</p>
<p>Change:	   -7.3%    1.5%	-5.5%    -7.0%     -6.5%</p>
<p>1997 YTD:	3619.2   50.2     2405.1     34.8     6109.3</p>
<p>1996 YTD:	3798.5   52.9     2651.4     41.1     6543.9</p>
<p>Change:	    -4.7%  -5.1%	-9.3%   -15.3%     -6.6%</p>
<p>LIVESTOCK SLAUGHTER (HEAD)</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING   CATTLE   CALVES/VEALERS     HOGS     SHEEP/LAMBS</p>
<p>22-Feb-97     662,000	   33,000     1,695,000	81,000</p>
<p>15-Feb-97     673,000	   33,000     1,705,000	82,000</p>
<p>Change:	  -1.6%	     0.0%	   -0.6%	 -1.2%</p>
<p>24-Feb-96     697,000	   32,000     1,808,000	86,000</p>
<p>Change:	  -5.0%	     3.1%	   -6.3%	 -5.8%</p>
<p>1997 YTD:   5,252,000	  240,000    12,776,000     530,000</p>
<p>1996 YTD:*  5,366,000	  252,000    14,238,000     636,000</p>
<p>Change:	  -2.1%	    -4.9%	  -10.3%	-16.6%</p>
<p>*1996 slaughter totals adjusted to reflect NASS revisions</p>
<p>AVERAGE WEIGHTS (LBS.)</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING  LIVE CATTLE   CALVES/VEALERS   HOGS  SHEEP/LAMBS</p>
<p>22-Feb-97    Est    1165	  343	   257	  132</p>
<p>15-Feb-97    Est    1163	  343	   258	  132</p>
<p>24-Feb-96    Actual 1184	  359	   255	  129</p>
<p>Dressed</p>
<p>22-Feb-97    Est     693	  212	   188	   66</p>
<p>15-Feb-97    Est     692	  212	   190	   66</p>
<p>24-Feb-96    Actual  706	  212	   186	   67</p>
<p>FOR THE WEEK PERCENTAGE OF TOTAL CATTLE SLAUGHTERED BY CLASS</p>
<p>ENDING	 STEERS	HEIFERS     COWS     BULLS &amp; STAGS</p>
<p>08-Feb-97    47.1%	  32.1%	19.1%	  1.7%</p>
<p>10-Feb-96    50.2%	  30.1%	18.1%	  1.5%</p>
<p>THE WEEK PERCENTAGE OF TOTAL HOGS SLAUGHTERED BY CLASS</p>
<p>ENDING	BARROWS &amp; GILTS	    SOWS     STAGS &amp; BOARS</p>
<p>08-Feb-97    96.0%			 3.3%	   0.7%</p>
<p>10-Feb-96    95.5%			 3.8%	   0.7%</p>
<p>*1996 slaughter totals adjusted to reflect NASS revisions.</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 YTD reflects six production days.</p>
<p>1997 YTD reflects four production days</p>
